[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Eitri
Comment=Your Neovim, tiled with your agents, terminals and the web pages you build, in one window.
Comment[zh_CN]=你的 Neovim，和 agent、终端、你自己做的网页一起，平铺在一个窗口里。
Exec=/usr/bin/eitri --quiet %f
Icon=cn.huntergrey.eitri
StartupWMClass=cn.huntergrey.eitri
Terminal=false
Categories=Development;TextEditor;
MimeType=inode/directory;
StartupNotify=true
